  "id": "nuvei-investment-thesis",
  "content": "# Nuvei — Investment Thesis\n\nNuvei is a Montreal-based payments infrastructure company serving merchants in 200+ markets. The core thesis is that Nuvei's modular platform creates compounding switching costs as merchants activate more modules over time.\n\nThe DCF suggests ~$8.2B fair value assuming 12% terminal revenue growth and 28% EBITDA margins, versus the Advent International take-private at $6.3B. The spread implies meaningful upside if margin expansion targets are met.\n\nKey risk: the integration of Paya and Till Payments introduces execution risk. The regulated gaming vertical — roughly 20% of revenue — is also exposed to regulatory shifts in key markets.",
